   "title": "Sangmidang seeks North American, European expansion through global partnerships",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/companies/20261028/sangmidang-seeks-north-american-european-expansion-through-global-partnerships",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
