   "title": "PPP slams defense minister over remarks on trusting US forces in event of war with N. Korea",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/politics/20261028/ppp-slams-defense-minister-over-remarks-on-trusting-us-forces-in-event-of-war-with-n-korea",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
