   "title": "NASENI’s Skill Acquisition, Youth Empowerment Programme Making Profound Impact In Kogi State",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/nasenis-skill-acquisition-youth-empowerment-programme-making-profound-impact-in-kogi-state/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
