   "title": "4 students, one lady killed in Niger governor’s convoy road crash",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/10/4-students-one-lady-killed-in-niger-governors-convoy-road-crash/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
