   "title": "FULL LIST: Rivers APC, PDP candidates in Wike’s 2027 Rainbow Coalition",
   "url": "https://punchng.com/full-list-rivers-apc-pdp-candidates-in-wikes-2027-rainbow-coalition/",
   "domain": "punchng.com",
   "source": "Punch（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:59:02 +0000",
   "_dt": 1793120342.0,
   "ageDays": 0.54,
   "summary": "The Rainbow Coalition led by the Minister of the Federal Capital Territory, Nyesom Wike, has unveiled its preferred candidates for the 2027 general elections in Rivers State, drawing from the All Progressives Congress and the Peoples Democratic Party. The coalition’s candidates include those contesting the governorship, Senate, House of Representatives and Rivers State House of Assembly seats. Below is the list of candidates released by Lere Olayinka, Wike’s aide, on X.",
   "summary_zh": "由联邦首都地区部长Nyesom Wike领导的“彩虹联盟”公布了其参加2027年Rivers州大选的首选候选人，人选来自进步大会党和人民民主党。该联盟候选人包括竞选州长、参议院、众议院及Rivers州议会议席的候选人。以下是Wike的助手Lere Olayinka在X上公布的候选人名单。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The Rainbow Coalition led by the Minister of the Federal Capital Territory, Nyesom Wike, has unveiled its preferred candidates for the 2027 general elections in Rivers State, drawing from the All Progressives Congress and the Peoples Democratic Party. The candidates were unveiled at a ceremony held at the Yakubu Gowon Stadium in Port Harcourt on Tuesday, October 27, as the coalition seeks to mobilise support for President Bola Tinubu’s re-election. The coalition’s candidates include those contesting the governorship, Senate, House of Representatives and Rivers State House of Assembly seats. Wike has said the coalition is designed to mobilise support for Tinubu across party lines, while allowing members to contest other elective positions under different political parties. Below is the list of candidates released by Lere Olayinka, Wike’s aide, on X. The list below follows the order of names, constituencies and party affiliations in the material released by the coalition. Samuel Omotere is an experienced journalist covering human interest stories, pop culture, and digital trends. He combines his background as a language graduate with a focus on sustainable digital storytelling",
